{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24613","headline":"送敏中新授户部员外郎西归 · 白居易","name":"送敏中新授户部员外郎西归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里归程三伏天，官新身健马翩翩。\n行冲赤日加餐饭，上到青云稳着鞭。\n长庆老郎唯我在，客曹故事望君传。\n前鸿後雁行难续，相去迢迢二十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}